  <OverHaulers_Calibration_Status_Emergency>Emergency Failsafe</OverHaulers_Calibration_Status_Emergency>
  <OverHaulers_Calibration_Desc_Emergency>Dummy calibration failed during or after the world-load sweep. The species uses the emergency fallback assumption (35 kg/size).</OverHaulers_Calibration_Desc_Emergency>

  <OverHaulers_Calibration_TaxonomyHeader>Baseline Resolution Taxonomy:&#10;• [0] Pristine Dummy: Clean stat resolution on an unspawned pawn.&#10;• [1] Testing Fallback: Non-caravan species or species awaiting the world-load sweep use the testing benchmark (35 kg/size).&#10;• [2] Emergency Failsafe: Dummy calibration failed during or after the sweep; the fallback assumption is used.</OverHaulers_Calibration_TaxonomyHeader>

